line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-wrap: wrap;\">한·미 대학생 연수(WEST) 프로그램을 운영하고 있습니다.</span></font><font face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap;\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">관심 있는 학생께서는 첨부하는 모집 공고를 확인하여 주시고, </span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">온라인 접수 개별 진행 및 소속대학에 제출해야 할 서류들을 </span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">2023년 8월 4일(금)까지 국제교류교육원 행정실(국제교육관 1층 103호)로</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">제출하여 주시기 바랍니다. </span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">*문의: 박수하 주무관(054-478-7223)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p></pre><pre style=\"font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 12.25px; overflow: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><pre style=\"font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 10.7188px; overflow: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><pre style=\"font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 10px; overflow: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 2; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(70, 115, 255); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">붙임 1.</span> 2023년 하반기 WEST 참가자 모집 공고</span></p></pre></pre></pre></pre>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
